text for="L54">恐惧着随风摇曳晃动</text><text for="L55">无人曾见证</text><text for="L56">本不该被看见</text><text for="L57">花儿在风中恐惧战栗</text><text for="L58">摇曳晃动</text><text for="L59">风儿将花的传闻吹送而来</text><text for="L60">花儿恐惧着摇曳晃动</text><text for="L61">花儿颤抖着恐惧晃动</text><text for="L62">颤抖着恐惧晃动</text><text for="L63">随风 随风 随风</text><text for="L64">随风摇曳晃动</text><text for="L65">仿佛在恐惧中蜷缩</text><text for="L66">花儿哭泣了哟</text><text for="L67">花儿</text><text for="L68">花儿哭泣了哟</text><text for="L69">被狂风狠狠击打</text><text for="L70">从未见过光芒</text><text for="L71">花儿默默哭泣着哟</text><text for="L72">比起刚才的风声更加</text><text for="L73">以风声为名的风</text><text for="L74">比起风的声音更加</text><text for="L75">以声音为名的风暴</text><text for="L76">风暴</text><text for="L77">风暴</text><text for="L78">若是那样</text><text for="L79">若是那样的话</text><text for="L80">花儿</text><text for="L81">花儿正在哭泣哟</text><text for="L82">没有梦境</text><text for="L83">连风也消失殆尽</text><text for="L84">明明连云都静止不动</text><text for="L85">明明如此 明明如此</text><text for="L86">花儿啊 那花儿啊</text><text for="L87">选择了黑暗</text><text for="L88">深爱着黑暗</text><text for="L89">花儿在黑暗中歌唱</text><text for="L90">爱恋着</text><text for="L91">为此哭泣</text><text for="L92">在黑暗中哭泣</text><text for="L93">明明如此 明明如此</text><text for="L94">花儿被迫在黑暗中哭泣</text><text for="L95">被选中 歌唱着 被爱着</text><text for="L96">从未见过光芒的花儿</text><text for="L97">被选择 被折磨 被爱怜</text><text for="L98">仿佛一直深爱着黑暗</text><text for="L99">花儿啊</text><text for="L100">在你不屈的心中</text><text for="L101">愿光芒能对你微笑</text><text for="L102">不屈服的心灵之花</text><text for="L103">愿不再被风摇曳</text><text for="L104">愿不再在黑暗中哭泣</text><text for="L105">愿不被剪刀斩断</text><text for="L106">愿不再摇曳</text><text for="L107">愿不再被迫哭泣</text><text for="L108">花儿啊请仰望月亮</text><text for="L109">星星不行哟</text><text for="L110">黑暗啊</text><text for="L111">月亮才是真正的光</text><text for="L112">不</text><text for="L113">星星也很美丽</text><text for="L114">如同月光般的存在</text><text for="L115">宛如真正星光的黑暗</text><text for="L116">是不行的</text><text for="L117">是黑暗</text><text for="L118">月亮才是真正的光</text><text for="L119">真正的光芒</text><text for="L120">真正的光芒</text><text for="L121">若要如此 就需推开</text><text for="L122">黑暗的浪潮</text><text for="L123">是破译暗月之人</text><text for="L124">为花儿带来光芒</text><text for="L125">为花儿带来光芒</text><text for="L126">为花儿带来光芒</text><text for="L127">曾如此祈求过</text><text for="L128">然后</text><text for="L129">若是那样的话</text><text for="L130">然后</text><text for="L131">若是那样的话</text><text for="L132">花儿作出了回答</text><text for="L133">仅此一次作出了回答</text><text for="L134">四次作出了回答</text><text for="L135">不需要光芒 请赐予我水吧</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Hana"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ASA-CHANG"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="JUNRAY"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Hana + Tuginepu"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="626134565"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB530100006"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:40.344" end="6:29.936"><p begin="0:40.344" end="0:42.914" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.344" end="0:40.721">花</span><span begin="0:40.721" end="0:41.592">が</span><span begin="0:41.592" end="0:41.827">咲</span><span begin="0:41.827" end="0:42.183">イ</span><span begin="0:42.183" end="0:42.627">タ</span><span begin="0:42.627" end="0:42.914">ヨ</span></p><p begin="0:44.135" end="0:46.250" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.135" end="0:45.889">花</span><span begin="0:45.889" end="0:46.250">が</span></p><p begin="0:46.543" end="0:47.979" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.543" end="0:46.696">ハ</span><span begin="0:46.696" end="0:47.031">ナ</span><span begin="0:47.031" end="0:47.269">ガ</span><span begin="0:47.269" end="0:47.464">サ</span><span begin="0:47.464" end="0:47.618">イ</span><span begin="0:47.618" end="0:47.774">タ</span><span begin="0:47.774" end="0:47.979">ヨ</span></p><p begin="0:48.912" end="0:51.560" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.912" end="0:49.059">ひ</span><span begin="0:49.059" end="0:49.214">ド</span><span begin="0:49.214" end="0:49.517">く</span><span begin="0:49.517" end="0:49.993">風</span><span begin="0